7. Relationship to QuAIR
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This catalog is a separate project built on top of Lean-QIT. It is not
maintained by QuAIR, and QuAIR has not reviewed or endorsed it. The name
"Lean-QIT" is used here to identify the library this catalog indexes, which is
what Apache-2.0 section 6 permits: reasonable and customary use in describing
the origin of the work.

QuAIR also publishes a hand-curated Theorem Catalog at
https://www.quairkit.com/Lean-QIT/ with readable mathematical statements and
literature citations. It is the better starting point for understanding the
library, and the catalog built on this dataset links to it throughout.

